  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Duo Power is a power-oriented hybrid combining Wilson NXT Power 16 / 1.30 mm with Luxilon ALU Power 16L / 1.25 mm. NXT Power contributes explosive elasticity, comfort and ball pocketing, while ALU Power adds spin, control, durability and directional stability. Wilson allows either string to be installed in the mains, letting players tune the setup toward firmer controlled power or softer free power. For ideal playability, Wilson recommends reducing ALU Power tension by at least 10%.",

    "zh": "Wilson Duo Power 是一套以最大力量为核心的官方 Hybrid，由 Wilson NXT Power 16 / 1.30 毫米与 Luxilon ALU Power 16L / 1.25 毫米组成。NXT Power 负责提供爆发性弹力、舒适性和 Ball Pocketing，而 ALU Power 则补充 Spin、Control、Durability 和方向稳定性。两根球线都可以作为主线使用：ALU Power 做主线时更加偏向可控的爆发力、旋转和稳定；NXT Power 做主线时则更加柔软、容易获得力量并具有更明显的 Pocketing。Wilson 建议 ALU Power 的穿线张力至少降低 10%，以获得理想可打性。"
  },

